{"data":{"body":"**P2 \u2014 Propagate JVM-fatal failures immediately.** After an end hook throws `VirtualMachineError` or `ThreadDeath`, this catch retains it and continues invoking arbitrary earlier hooks. A blocking hook can prevent the fatal condition from ever escaping. Rethrow JVM-fatal errors immediately and aggregate only nonfatal end-hook errors.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOQwbyFc774RjR","finding_digest":"c92b7c1747a290739ec238dd4ec3ebca21a44760e63e5f5597374768eeaf7d5f","finding_id":"arf_v1_zevxyf2hukihhhwchdou5q7lzi","finding_key":"sdk/execution/durableexecutor::finalizeafterhandlerscopes::scope-fatal-observation-liveness","identity_key":"sdk/execution/durableexecutor::finalizeafterhandlerscopes::scope-fatal-observation-liveness","line":113,"observation_digest":"8a98f8aa6b00ce3f71ba553e25b5d27f150a920a62721c0116444e91059da587","observation_id":"aro_v1_rkmprktladhd64n2ku7clnosp4","path":"sdk/src/main/java/software/amazon/lambda/durable/plugin/PluginRunner.java","prior_finding_id":"arf_v1_zevxyf2hukihhhwchdou5q7lzi","published_at":"2026-10-09T01:40:05Z","review_id":"arr_v1_dfsghg7x42wurlqw3jtatlfyq7","reviewed_base_sha":"0c8618e42d3b16e9b7115ab943a93253c0fe936c","reviewed_head_sha":"e28732585b856fb3f3117acf4b2d8b5162423d7c","reviewer":"codex","start_line":113,"suggestion_id":""},"pull_request":{"number":769},"record_id":"art_v1_dv6zml4cxplr5slydmjismz377","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-10-09T01:40:05Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-sdk-java","id":1124528661},"schema_version":1}
